                <pb facs="0179" n="63" xml:id="pg63"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.00/966.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-01-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 20, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Republican ultimatum demands that Yuan shall not set up a provisional government
                    after the abdication.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Calhoun</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
